Maintainer: Gael Millot <gael.millot@pasteur.fr>
Description: A 'shiny' app, launched by make(), that converts a user R function into a function written according to the safer-r project recommendations for R function development (see <https://github.com/safer-r>), and a test() function that runs the safer-r code checks of the 'saferDev' package on a function. This includes strict checking of argument values, explicit package namespace qualification of all the called functions and explicit writing of all their arguments, among other things.
URL: https://github.com/safer-r/saferMake
